#: models.py:23
msgid "Display Name:"
msgstr "Ko‘rsatiladigan nom:"

#: models.py:26
msgid "This name appears in the horizontal navigation at the top of the page."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu nom sahifaning yuqori qismidagi gorizontal navigatsiyada ko‘rinadi."

#: models.py:29
msgid "Link Text:"
msgstr "Havola matni:"

#: models.py:32
msgid "This is the text that will link to your survey."
msgstr "Bu sizning so‘rovingizga havola qiladigan matn."

#: models.py:35
msgid "Message:"
msgstr "Xabar:"

#: models.py:38
msgid "This is the text that will be displayed above the link to your survey."
msgstr "Bu sizning so‘rovnomangizga havola ustida ko‘rsatiladigan matn."

#: models.py:41
msgid "Extra Parameters:"
msgstr "Qoʻshimcha parametrlar:"

#: models.py:45
msgid ""
"Additional query parameters to include in the survey URL. Format: "
"key1=value1&key2=value2. If blank, no extra parameters are added."
msgstr ""
"So‘rov URL manziliga kiritiladigan qo‘shimcha so‘rov parametrlari. Format: "
"key1=value1&key2=value2. Agar bo‘sh qoldirilsa, hech qanday qo‘shimcha "
"parametrlar qo‘shilmaydi."

#: models.py:51
msgid "Survey ID:"
msgstr "So‘rov identifikatori:"

#: models.py:55
msgid ""
"This is the ID that Qualtrics uses for the survey, which can include numbers"
" and letters, and should be entered in the following format: "
"SV_###############"
msgstr ""
"Bu Qualtrics so‘rov uchun foydalanadigan identifikator bo‘lib, u raqamlar va"
" harflarni o‘z ichiga olishi mumkin va quyidagi formatda kiritilishi kerak: "
"SV_##############"

#: models.py:61
msgid "Your University:"
msgstr "Sizning universitetingiz:"

#: models.py:65
msgid ""
"The subdomain for your university's Qualtrics account "
"(e.g.'stanforduniversity'). If left blank, the system-wide default is used."
msgstr ""
"Universitetingizning Qualtrics akkaunti uchun subdomen (masalan, "
"'stanforduniversity'). Agar boʻsh qoldirilsa, tizim boʻyicha standart qiymat"
" ishlatiladi."
